Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"johnson",
    "email":"johnson@gmail.com",
    "password":"Johnson@123"
}

### USER LOGIN API
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"johnson",
    "password":"Johnson@123"
}

